      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Delivering an oral presentation in conferences and meetings can seem daunting. However, if delivered effectively, it can be an invaluable opportunity to showcase your work in front of peers as well as receive feedback on your project. In this \"How to\" article, we demonstrate how one can plan and successfully deliver an engaging oral presentation."},
